# `lifecycle validate --stage design`/`--stage plan`.
#
# design: happy path (well-formed design.md) plus a findings path for a
# sibling change missing the NFR-discharge heading.
#
# plan: change 007 (M5/M6) retired tasks.md — the plan stage now gates the
# change's plan.yaml, validated by milestoned-plan-dag. A change with no
# plan.yaml fails the plan gate naming the missing artifact (a hermetic
# assertion needing no external binary; the present-and-valid path is
# covered by internal/validate/plan_gate_test.go against a stub).

exitcode 0 lifecycle validate --stage design --change good-design
stdout 'good-design: ok'

exitcode 1 lifecycle validate --stage design --change bad-design
stdout 'missing an explicit NFR-discharge section'

exitcode 1 lifecycle validate --stage plan --change no-plan
stdout 'plan.yaml not found'

-- openspec/changes/good-design/design.md --
# Title — Design

## Context
Background.

## NFR Discharge
- Latency: p99 under 200ms, verified by benchmark.

## Risks / Trade-offs
None known.

-- openspec/changes/bad-design/design.md --
# Title — Design

## Context
Background, but no NFR section at all.

-- openspec/changes/no-plan/proposal.md --
---
issue: "kentra-io/kafka-dq#42"
---

